{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totjimon Islands</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder in the style of <i>Luck be a Landlord</i>. Embark on an adventure across islands inhabited by all sorts of monsters and build powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose which cards go into your deck, but which of them appear on the field \u2014 and where \u2014 is up to chance. Still, smart decisions will let you take control of the situation. Building your deck wisely is all you need to worry about!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elemental Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don\u2019t just build your deck \u2014 you decide which parts of it will show up in the next round. At any time, you can enable or disable specific elements from appearing on the field, opening up a whole new layer of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element has unique traits and synergies that can be used in many different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.mp4?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Your Opponents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path is blocked by rival elemental masters and monsters. Each one has their own deck of cards and their own plan to stop you! Enemy cards appear on the field alongside yours \u2014 turn that to your advantage, or find a way to disrupt their strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.mp4?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you\u2019ll choose your route across the islands. You\u2019ll encounter more than just enemies \u2014 traders, rest stops, and surprises await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/7e69214a6651f365a901dbe839139712.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/7e69214a6651f365a901dbe839139712.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/7e69214a6651f365a901dbe839139712.mp4?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up Your Mons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mons are constantly gaining experience and getting stronger. When they level up, you get to choose a new talent, giving you even more options for building unique and powerful strategies. Earn enough levels, and your mon will evolve into a stronger version!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932950?t=1755254731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932950?t=1755254731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/8b52d343e28a695fd6ec1e0577ed1ba797ea784a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755254731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/8b52d343e28a695fd6ec1e0577ed1ba797ea784a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755254731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totjimon Islands</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder in the style of <i>Luck be a Landlord</i>. Embark on an adventure across islands inhabited by all sorts of monsters and build powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose which cards go into your deck, but which of them appear on the field \u2014 and where \u2014 is up to chance. Still, smart decisions will let you take control of the situation. Building your deck wisely is all you need to worry about!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elemental Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don\u2019t just build your deck \u2014 you decide which parts of it will show up in the next round. At any time, you can enable or disable specific elements from appearing on the field, opening up a whole new layer of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element has unique traits and synergies that can be used in many different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/d0fbdfd36ea164e64cd07bccd8f422eb.mp4?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Your Opponents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path is blocked by rival elemental masters and monsters. Each one has their own deck of cards and their own plan to stop you! Enemy cards appear on the field alongside yours \u2014 turn that to your advantage, or find a way to disrupt their strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/c03daafc5828d172d5fc0a24bee9cadd.mp4?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you\u2019ll choose your route across the islands. You\u2019ll encounter more than just enemies \u2014 traders, rest stops, and surprises await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/7e69214a6651f365a901dbe839139712.poster.avif?t=1755254731\" width=626 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932950/extras/7e69214a6651f365a901dbe839139712.webm?t=1755254731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour